[{"automatic_diacritization_used":false,"book_id":"1CO","book_name":"1 Corinthians","chapter":12,"id":"1CO.12.12","machine_translation_used":false,"source_id":"ebible_world_english_bible","source_url":"https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp","text":"For as the body is one and has many members, and all the members of the body, being many, are one body; so also is Christ.","text_sha256":"3a6c34a1d5c9a3680c28fd2a0cd37c0ea664c20e13a493a369843812546459d1","verse":12},{"automatic_diacritization_used":false,"book_id":"1CO","book_name":"1 Corinthians","chapter":12,"id":"1CO.12.13","machine_translation_used":false,"source_id":"ebible_world_english_bible","source_url":"https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp","text":"For in one Spirit we were all baptized into one body, whether Jews or Greeks, whether bond or free; and were all given to drink into one Spirit.","text_sha256":"5f718463c3cca810e6dc36dc4026c2268291bfc1fd832272b58a8e16cfcd6621","verse":13},{"automatic_diacritization_used":false,"book_id":"1CO","book_name":"1 Corinthians","chapter":12,"id":"1CO.12.14","machine_translation_used":false,"source_id":"ebible_world_english_bible","source_url":"https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp","text":"For the body is not one member, but many.","text_sha256":"1afdeab574ccdce047419148be9dc37c2c093598b15ca62e4f43aa3a2d074310","verse":14},{"automatic_diacritization_used":false,"book_id":"1CO","book_name":"1 Corinthians","chapter":12,"id":"1CO.12.15","machine_translation_used":false,"source_id":"ebible_world_english_bible","source_url":"https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp","text":"If the foot would say, “Because I’m not the hand, I’m not part of the body,” it is not therefore not part of the body.","text_sha256":"6d9d0155b8b979f9267d732d7674acfd0988fba8efaa38abd7bf044d89953463","verse":15},{"automatic_diacritization_used":false,"book_id":"1CO","book_name":"1 Corinthians","chapter":12,"id":"1CO.12.16","machine_translation_used":false,"source_id":"ebible_world_english_bible","source_url":"https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp","text":"If the ear would say, “Because I’m not the eye, I’m not part of the body,” it’s not therefore not part of the body.","text_sha256":"aa4baa76b97c657d8830b78dad275395d392c0b790180a7401a04e663fc385ff","verse":16},{"automatic_diacritization_used":false,"book_id":"1CO","book_name":"1 Corinthians","chapter":12,"id":"1CO.12.17","machine_translation_used":false,"source_id":"ebible_world_english_bible","source_url":"https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp","text":"If the whole body were an eye, where would the hearing be? If the whole were hearing, where would the smelling be?","text_sha256":"8362146ecd264931ade04b2da8a89cdd290f160524967c8e3c2f99710677fb73","verse":17},{"automatic_diacritization_used":false,"book_id":"1CO","book_name":"1 Corinthians","chapter":12,"id":"1CO.12.18","machine_translation_used":false,"source_id":"ebible_world_english_bible","source_url":"https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp","text":"But now God has set the members, each one of them, in the body, just as he desired.","text_sha256":"04fe367c82f41900c2dc92eda2493135d340fe85de5caf5df64139b691a8d844","verse":18},{"automatic_diacritization_used":false,"book_id":"1CO","book_name":"1 Corinthians","chapter":12,"id":"1CO.12.19","machine_translation_used":false,"source_id":"ebible_world_english_bible","source_url":"https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp","text":"If they were all one member, where would the body be?","text_sha256":"48c0fd7a0147f278a9a1d3b08ad885bb2269a3667bcb88f3d013ce8d47348a11","verse":19},{"automatic_diacritization_used":false,"book_id":"1CO","book_name":"1 Corinthians","chapter":12,"id":"1CO.12.20","machine_translation_used":false,"source_id":"ebible_world_english_bible","source_url":"https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp","text":"But now they are many members, but one body.","text_sha256":"88cab85b105f11427a70ee533222eabc6cc378481afa4005aff2f349a7ba742e","verse":20},{"automatic_diacritization_used":false,"book_id":"1CO","book_name":"1 Corinthians","chapter":12,"id":"1CO.12.21","machine_translation_used":false,"source_id":"ebible_world_english_bible","source_url":"https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp","text":"The eye can’t tell the hand, “I have no need for you,” or again the head to the feet, “I have no need for you.”","text_sha256":"f57e24934a3a82f1e26aca0a1f9ae28eb0b4c3fc4c18decc6896d3a3cc77f9f0","verse":21},{"automatic_diacritization_used":false,"book_id":"1CO","book_name":"1 Corinthians","chapter":12,"id":"1CO.12.22","machine_translation_used":false,"source_id":"ebible_world_english_bible","source_url":"https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp","text":"No, much rather, those members of the body which seem to be weaker are necessary.","text_sha256":"7029760c2fdb22e409d170b1c665f0d74d6ae6c5cee5fc8f492c42ec14388b21","verse":22},{"automatic_diacritization_used":false,"book_id":"1CO","book_name":"1 Corinthians","chapter":12,"id":"1CO.12.23","machine_translation_used":false,"source_id":"ebible_world_english_bible","source_url":"https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp","text":"Those parts of the body which we think to be less honorable, on those we bestow more abundant honor; and our unpresentable parts have more abundant modesty,","text_sha256":"f90c9da7edc72fd0dc0c6099d99f76f3760b81e9787c3a17cf265d1844482920","verse":23},{"automatic_diacritization_used":false,"book_id":"1CO","book_name":"1 Corinthians","chapter":12,"id":"1CO.12.24","machine_translation_used":false,"source_id":"ebible_world_english_bible","source_url":"https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp","text":"while our presentable parts have no such need. But God composed the body together, giving more abundant honor to the inferior part,","text_sha256":"d3c5896c329a44aed3902ed144a8a9e68325a50aec13ae4e37fb965460d40f4f","verse":24},{"automatic_diacritization_used":false,"book_id":"1CO","book_name":"1 Corinthians","chapter":12,"id":"1CO.12.25","machine_translation_used":false,"source_id":"ebible_world_english_bible","source_url":"https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp","text":"that there should be no division in the body, but that the members should have the same care for one another.","text_sha256":"344ae4b5dc175c6da2e72b86c653d10f757224556fe41f6421ad60ee6e44c77b","verse":25},{"automatic_diacritization_used":false,"book_id":"1CO","book_name":"1 Corinthians","chapter":12,"id":"1CO.12.26","machine_translation_used":false,"source_id":"ebible_world_english_bible","source_url":"https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp","text":"When one member suffers, all the members suffer with it. When one member is honored, all the members rejoice with it.","text_sha256":"b18c7dfbc54b027dc8885ad0043cfe3a7c86327f8cdc1ae967a60a6569f7aed9","verse":26},{"automatic_diacritization_used":false,"book_id":"MAT","book_name":"Matthew","chapter":18,"id":"MAT.18.18","machine_translation_used":false,"source_id":"ebible_world_english_bible","source_url":"https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp","text":"Most certainly I tell you, whatever things you bind on earth will have been bound in heaven, and whatever things you release on earth will have been released in heaven.","text_sha256":"35abadf3d036e3367a6e0386ba2378cd128e12828363710b3f1f235eccbec442","verse":18},{"automatic_diacritization_used":false,"book_id":"MAT","book_name":"Matthew","chapter":18,"id":"MAT.18.19","machine_translation_used":false,"source_id":"ebible_world_english_bible","source_url":"https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp","text":"Again, assuredly I tell you, that if two of you will agree on earth concerning anything that they will ask, it will be done for them by my Father who is in heaven.","text_sha256":"9790b70c11dd84b87a271444782d0e8cff49d6ab59db9f0275a645af8597b646","verse":19},{"automatic_diacritization_used":false,"book_id":"MAT","book_name":"Matthew","chapter":18,"id":"MAT.18.20","machine_translation_used":false,"source_id":"ebible_world_english_bible","source_url":"https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp","text":"For where two or three are gathered together in my name, there I am in the middle of them.”","text_sha256":"e9c11b90ce109c273e467b7b8251ebaf6652814111e3f333a7cfe0d5b3d9de63","verse":20},{"automatic_diacritization_used":false,"book_id":"MAT","book_name":"Matthew","chapter":18,"id":"MAT.18.21","machine_translation_used":false,"source_id":"ebible_world_english_bible","source_url":"https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp","text":"Then Peter came and said to him, “Lord, how often shall my brother sin against me, and I forgive him? Until seven times?”","text_sha256":"75688441360570a885d26517d3a65c16b0227598c2d4c789c2b0d7c72299e68f","verse":21},{"automatic_diacritization_used":false,"book_id":"MAT","book_name":"Matthew","chapter":18,"id":"MAT.18.22","machine_translation_used":false,"source_id":"ebible_world_english_bible","source_url":"https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp","text":"Jesus said to him, “I don’t tell you until seven times, but, until seventy times seven.","text_sha256":"5c778f72d59ffd924ac0c08913fe1dcfb134737acbc2d4256d226a9daaa01f0f","verse":22},{"automatic_diacritization_used":false,"book_id":"MAT","book_name":"Matthew","chapter":19,"id":"MAT.19.1","machine_translation_used":false,"source_id":"ebible_world_english_bible","source_url":"https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp","text":"When Jesus had finished these words, he departed from Galilee and came into the borders of Judea beyond the Jordan.","text_sha256":"7877544cf236313172d41d2ca41e91220114a333f41a099d6d445793a64bedde","verse":1},{"automatic_diacritization_used":false,"book_id":"MAT","book_name":"Matthew","chapter":19,"id":"MAT.19.2","machine_translation_used":false,"source_id":"ebible_world_english_bible","source_url":"https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp","text":"Great multitudes followed him, and he healed them there.","text_sha256":"db5a900266ed89e0194521e8f89a4b38bf56620caf71be2e85778767ce38d08a","verse":2},{"automatic_diacritization_used":false,"book_id":"MAT","book_name":"Matthew","chapter":19,"id":"MAT.19.13","machine_translation_used":false,"source_id":"ebible_world_english_bible","source_url":"https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp","text":"Then little children were brought to him that he should lay his hands on them and pray; and the disciples rebuked them.","text_sha256":"e45b1a9d023bd82ecee83235c192b4834f90914e24ff220339319b3783d58a03","verse":13},{"automatic_diacritization_used":false,"book_id":"MAT","book_name":"Matthew","chapter":19,"id":"MAT.19.14","machine_translation_used":false,"source_id":"ebible_world_english_bible","source_url":"https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp","text":"But Jesus said, “Allow the little children, and don’t forbid them to come to me; for the Kingdom of Heaven belongs to ones like these.”","text_sha256":"aeebc89eb14041fae9526f007d830ab1c7e040f45c7787527dd8883ff7822303","verse":14},{"automatic_diacritization_used":false,"book_id":"MAT","book_name":"Matthew","chapter":19,"id":"MAT.19.15","machine_translation_used":false,"source_id":"ebible_world_english_bible","source_url":"https://ebible.org/find/details.php?id=engwebp","text":"He laid his hands on them, and departed from there.","text_sha256":"92c23b0a6d1708b0261848f69b8854137e4f6088cda7f56a8edd4595fa31619e","verse":15}]
